What is Printed Circuit Board Repair?
Printed Circuit Board (PCB) repair involves specialized techniques to restore functionality to damaged circuit boards through component replacement, trace repair, and solder rework. Unlike complete board replacement, repair strategies preserve expensive embedded components while reducing e-waste. The process requires sophisticated diagnostic equipment and skilled technicians capable of handling multilayer boards with high-density interconnects.
